# Papers are NEVER committed. ADR-0005 section 3: records, not PDFs.
# Most published papers are not redistributable and several in the seed set are
# vendor or conference material. The access field points at a DOI, an arXiv id,
# or a local path. The seed PDFs live at D:/Data/Harold/EvidenceBasedDB/Papers,
# deliberately outside this repository.
Papers/
Books/
GitHubRepos/
References/
*.pdf

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The store lives OUTSIDE the repository (ADR-0004 A7, 2026-10-06):
# D:\Data\Harold\EvidenceBasedDB\store, override EBDB_STORE_DIR. No database and
# no export is committed. These patterns stay so a stray copy never lands.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# Verified store backups (F30, Sprint 5 Task A): beside the store, outside the
# repository since ADR-0004 A7. Never committed.
store/backups/
backups/

# On-demand dumps (scripts/regenerate_export.py --out) are written outside the
# repository; store.export.regenerate refuses a folder inside it.
export/

# The team lead's API key (Sprint 17 plan Q1, F144). Never committed; Claude
# never reads it (.claude/hooks/block_env_secret_reads.py).
.env

# Local Claude state
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.lock
# The suite runner's verdict and log (scripts/run_suite.py, Sprint 11 I2)
.claude/suite_verdict.json
.claude/suite_last.log
